{
  "description": "Sunset decision contract. Each case parses a config (`config` names an entry in `configs`, serialized back to JSON; `configText` is raw text; neither means no config), then decides for `platform`, the installed `appVersion`, the device `osVersion` and the user's preferred `languages`. `decision` is upToDate, softUpdate or hardUpdate; prompts carry `storeURL`, the resolved `message` (null: the UI shows its default text) and the platform block's `latestVersion` (null when the block has none). Anything missing, malformed or unknown fails open (upToDate).",
